# An ADR uses a German status (ADR-0001: ADR format is English)
command: cargo xtask docs
expect: status `akzeptiert` is invalid
--- patch
diff --git a/docs/adr/0001-documentation-adrs-and-repository-language.md b/docs/adr/0001-documentation-adrs-and-repository-language.md
--- a/docs/adr/0001-documentation-adrs-and-repository-language.md
+++ b/docs/adr/0001-documentation-adrs-and-repository-language.md
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ---
 id: ADR-0001
 title: Decisions live in about 15 topic ADRs that are updated in place, the repository is English, and xtask checks the documentation
-status: accepted
+status: akzeptiert
 date: 2026-11-23
 crates: [xtask, qoob3d-app]
 tags: [documentation, process, ai, i18n]
